        "paragraphs": [
            "MoonshotAI Kimi is a family of large language models from the developer Moonshot AI, offered through the Kimi API Platform. The platform provides Kimi K3, Kimi K2.7 Code, Kimi K2.6 and other large language model APIs, supporting long context, multimodal understanding, and Tool Calling. Moonshot AI says Kimi K3 is its flagship model for long-horizon coding and end-to-end knowledge work, with a 1M-token context window and industry-leading intelligence. Kimi K2.7 Code is for coding, multimodal input, thinking, tool calling, and 256K-token contexts, and has a high-speed variant. Kimi K2.6 covers text, image, and video understanding, thinking mode, tool calling, and a 256K-token context window.",
            "The family also includes thinking modes, with reasoning effort values low, high, and max to balance Kimi K3 reasoning depth, latency, and token usage. Moonshot AI offers the models through the Kimi API Platform, which is pay-as-you-go with no subscription plan, and through Kimi Code, a separate coding product whose API keys are not interchangeable with Open Platform keys. Kimi Code CLI is a terminal-based AI agent that can use an API Key created on Kimi API Platform. The platform also documents integrations such as Codex, Claude Code, OpenClaw, OpenCode, Hermes Agent, and ModelScope MCP Server."
        ],
